        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891940/extras/de8d160022cb8fd639257a6cff9fe21b.avif?t=1760036561\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Path of the Sphere (PotS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the intensity of life and roll into the maze 😮‍💨. Path of the Sphere is a a relaxing labyrinth game where you guide a colorful sphere through 35 levels of mazes. No pressure, no deadlines, no conflicts. Just soothing gameplay in your own way and at your own pace. 😌</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES OF THE GAME</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🍃 35 levels of labyrinth at start </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📟 Endless levels on request</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚙️ Customise your experience with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎶 Music (Calm for a more relaxing play or Intense to spark your challenging side)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔉 Sound effects (hear the ball roll or turn it to enjoy just the music)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🕘 Timer (Display it digitally or in a classic analog style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🗺️ Minimap (Switch it on for smoother play, or off for extra challenge)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌟 Level Select panel to replay your favourites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⌨️ Keyboard friendly controls (WASD and arrow keys)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📋 In-game updates panel so you're always informed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌸 Tap Illaza, our chibi mascot, in the main menu to visit our socials</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO SHOULD PLAY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There is something for everyone in PotS </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=